``But hardly anything in our book would be changed by the adoption of a different form of the doctrine of types.'' (Whitehead and Russell, 2026, p. vii)
\par
``In the matter of notation, we have as far as possible followed Peano, supplementing his notation, when necessary, by that of Frege or by that of Schr\"oder.'' (Whitehead and Russell, 2026, p. viii)
